meta {
  name: Files
  seq: 11
}

docs {
  Upload and download through this gateway to GM.FileStorage.Samples' files API (https://localhost:7140), which
  must be running. Both need a sign-in (Accounts/Login first): the gateway forwards the signed-in user as
  X-User-Id and their tenant as X-Tenant-Id, so the file is recorded as theirs.

  Upload File saves the new file's id as fileId; Download File reads it back.
}
